 ProductHub — Product Management Dashboard

> Live Demo: https://preetham66-6.github.io/product-management-dashboard/

A production-quality, pure-frontend Product Management Dashboard built with HTML5, Tailwind CSS, and vanilla JavaScript ES modules.

Features

- Full CRUD — Create, read, update, and delete products
- Debounced search — Name search (250ms debounce, case-insensitive)
- Dynamic category filter** — Dropdown built from live product data
- Price sorting — Low → High, High → Low, or default insertion order
- Stock badges — Out of Stock (red), Low Stock (amber), In Stock (green)
- Product details modal — Full info view with Edit and Delete actions
- Confirmation modal — No browser `confirm()` — custom accessible dialog
- Inline form validation — Per-field, on blur + on submit, with live error clearing
- Seed data — 12 realistic products across 5 categories on first load
- Summary cards — Total products, inventory value, low stock, out-of-stock count
- Toast notifications — Create / update / delete success and error toasts
- Dark mode — Toggle with persistence via localStorage
- Responsive — Table on desktop, card layout on mobile; works at 360px, 768px, 1280px

 Tech Stack 
HTML5   Tailwind CSS     Vanilla JS     Lucide Icons    


